<misterromdescription>
    <name>Hydra (prototype 5/14/90)</name>
    <mratimestamp>20260926</mratimestamp>
    <mameversion>0264</mameversion>
    <setname>hydrap</setname>
    <year>1990</year>
    <manufacturer>Atari Games</manufacturer>
    <category>Racing</category>
    <rbf>Gm0rk_Atari-G1</rbf>
    <rotation>horizontal</rotation>
    <players>1</players>
    <num_buttons>6</num_buttons>
    <buttons names="Left Trigger,Right Trigger,Left Thumb,Right Thumb,Boost,Pedal,Coin" default="A,B,X,Y,L,R,Select"/>

    <romstruct>
SDRAM layout, the same for every Atari G1 set (unused space is zero-filled):
000000 - 07FFFF  512K  68000 program
080000 - 27FFFF    2M  RLE motion objects
280000 - 2FFFFF  512K  playfield planes 0-3
300000 - 31FFFF  128K  playfield plane 4
320000 - 33FFFF  128K  alpha characters
340000 - 37FFFF  256K  OKI6295 samples
380000 - 38FFFF   64K  JSA II 6502 program
390000 - 3905FF  1.5K  motion object PROMs
    </romstruct>

    <rom index="0" zip="hydrap.zip|hydra.zip" md5="7c838aa04c5d4071322d5b3721bdca31">

        <!-- $000000  68000 program -->
        <interleave output="16">
            <part name="hydhi0.bin" crc="dab2e8a2" map="01"/>
            <part name="hydlo0.bin" crc="c18d4f16" map="10"/>
        </interleave>
        <interleave output="16">
            <part name="hydhi1.bin" crc="50c12bb9" map="01"/>
            <part name="hydlo1.bin" crc="5ee0a846" map="10"/>
